    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4986e8c05e4c8f673667459e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“高松宫纪念”当天有公主战士表演秀，\n而且我崇拜的帝王也会参加这场比赛。\n这场表演跟比赛，能为我带来什么变化吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "376b62b0c8a5ce8f3317957fc95482b1b69a890eacbdaafd1d2ad215c768949e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
