    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893fd57875ce485cd54b46af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在“高松宫纪念”拿下冠军，\n赢过了帝王……但是她很自豪\n自己光明正大地奋战到最后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2946995c8ebd4c5516150e2b38863c21283e99f4378fc11d5b554516a64d5d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b431f7c9a5548a8b8c77664",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且她仿佛看穿了我心中的迷惘，\n告诉我要\n“为自己的作风感到骄傲”……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "745d391964eeecbeb17a4fd14f53016a860fee664a402f609f5ed4b1fa7e22a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1788632a78a8fa12bdbbee7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……要贯彻自己的作风，就不能害怕伤害别人！\n我希望自己能抬头挺胸地怀着这种想法，\n便决定参加粉丝感谢祭的座谈会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98636e3c54b85ee3963d6435e7735f27284ded70bc53b805820015cf2f23ae5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
