      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没关系！反正我是想成为\n“能让自己感到骄傲的理想公主”！\n伏特加好像也感受到我的意念了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd222f586be1aa24f1bb7407563d36876a5321e7909a8d0bd9a7159655715a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
