      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一次要挑战的是“伊丽莎白女王杯”。\n不出所料，有些人认为我配不上女王宝座，\n但这并不成问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde6343de74e27b06c4ea115bd9bf4fb719ca889d8fcc71a52302d271e0dc790",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
